IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-definitions`
IMPORT `P8-gate`
IMPORT `P8-art75a`

-- Tests of Article 75a (inserted by the Omnibus). The group General applies from 2 August 2026 (Art 113).

`Art 75a test on` MEANS Date 2 8 2026
`Art 75a test before` MEANS Date 1 8 2026

§ `Art 75a(1) and (2)`

#ASSERT `Art 75a(1) first sentence the AI Office has all the powers of a market surveillance authority provided for in this Section and in Article 14(4) and Article 16(3) of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 75a test on` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 75a(1) first sentence the AI Office has all the powers of a market surveillance authority provided for in this Section and in Article 14(4) and Article 16(3) of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 75a test on` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 75a(1) first sentence the AI Office has all the powers of a market surveillance authority provided for in this Section and in Article 14(4) and Article 16(3) of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 75a test before` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 75a(1) second sentence the AI Office is authorised to fully reclaim from the relevant operator the totality of the costs of its supervision and enforcement activities` `Art 75a test on` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 75a(1) second sentence the AI Office is authorised to fully reclaim from the relevant operator the totality of the costs of its supervision and enforcement activities` `Art 75a test on` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 75a(1) second sentence the AI Office is authorised to fully reclaim from the relevant operator the totality of the costs of its supervision and enforcement activities` `Art 75a test on` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 75a(1) second sentence the AI Office is authorised to fully reclaim from the relevant operator the totality of the costs of its supervision and enforcement activities` `Art 75a test before` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 75a(1) third sentence Article 17 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 applies mutatis mutandis` `Art 75a test on` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 75a(1) third sentence Article 17 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 applies mutatis mutandis` `Art 75a test before` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 75a(2) first sentence the AI Office may adopt a decision to start an investigation into the non-compliance` `Art 75a test on` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 75a(2) first sentence the AI Office may adopt a decision to start an investigation into the non-compliance` `Art 75a test on` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 75a(2) first sentence the AI Office may adopt a decision to start an investigation into the non-compliance` `Art 75a test before` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 75a(2) first sentence the AI Office's choice to adopt a decision to start an investigation` `Art 75a test on` TRUE AT (Day (Date 3 8 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party AI Office` DOES `Art 75a(2) adopt a decision to start an investigation into the non-compliance` AT (Day (Date 4 8 2026))
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
